  "Description": "Build s&box games by talking to Claude or any MCP client. 273 native editor tools across 28 discoverable toolsets cover GameObjects, scripts, scenes, components, physics, networking, UI, world generation, lighting, characters, placement, model geometry, camera verification, local multiplayer testing, diagnostics, and complete game-system scaffolds. The bridge runs on s&box's built-in local MCP server; the companion Codex/Claude plugin adds onboarding, workflow skills, the code-grounded cookbook, and optional editor-down lifeline diagnostics.",
